{"title": "Song of Defence", "pageid": 48930, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Song_of_Defence", "categories": ["Class features", "Passive features", "Patch 8 content"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Song_of_Defence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Song_of_Defence.webp/300px-Song_of_Defence.webp, /w/images/2/21/Song_of_Defence.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/21/Song_of_Defence.webp/300px-Song_of_Defence.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/21/Song_of_Defence.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Song of Defence</b> is a passive feature/reaction available to <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesinging\" title=\"Bladesinging\">Bladesinging</a> wizards which lets them expend spell slots to reduce incoming damage.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When you take damage during your <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/38px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/50px-Bladesong_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Bladesong\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp/25px-Bladesong_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/80/Bladesong_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesong\" title=\"Bladesong\">Bladesong</a>, you can expend a spell slot to subtract 5 damage per spell slot. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/30px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png/20px-Spell_Slot_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/ef/Spell_Slot_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spells#Spell_slots\" title=\"Spells\">Level 1 Spell Slot</a></span> </dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Classes:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>Class level 10: <a href=\"/wiki/Bladesinger\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bladesinger\">Bladesinger</a></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>This reaction only triggers against attacks which have an <a href=\"/wiki/Attack_roll\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Attack roll\">attack roll</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<div class=\"navbox-styles\"><style data-mw-deduplicate=\"TemplateStyles:r138587\">.mw-parser-output .hlist dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist dl,.mw-parser-output .bg3wiki-horizontlist ul{margin:0;padding:0}.mw-parser-output .hlist dl ul,.mw-parser-output .hlist dl dl,.mw-parser-output .hlist ul dl,.mw-parser-output .hli